        "created_at": "2018-04-27T21:08:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This looks like he’ll take a loooot of setup, but once he’s ready he’ll be putting out a lot of damage, plus potentially helping other heroes do stuff on his turn, basically every turn. Given the ridiculous number of power uses (three in a turn!) I can really see him shooting to MVP. Just as long as he can keep his cards out there!</p>",
