        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-27T21:49:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't think he'll take anywhere near as much setup as AA or AZ.&nbsp; Deployment Actuator, Flash Installation Drive, Micro Fabricator, Upgraded Memory Unit, Intel Analyzer, and Load On Initialization all help build him out faster, and the more of those you put out, the faster his setup goes.&nbsp; Full wipes will rip him apart, but otherwise, he can build momentum (unless he gets a really bad draw).&nbsp; And his Supply and Demand variant goes even faster.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
